  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Charts is a powerful and feature-rich data visualization control that supports over 50 chart types including Line, Area, Column, Bar, Pie, Doughnut, Scatter, Bubble, Waterfall, Box Plot, Histogram, and many more. It includes advanced features like multiple axes, zooming and panning, crosshair, trackball, technical indicators, trend lines, annotations, export options, and real-time data updates. The control is fully responsive and supports globalization and accessibility, making it the ideal choice for analytics and reporting in ASP.NET MVC applications.",
